        </ul>
        <br />
        <div class="heading2box">
            <span class="heading2" id="aboutus">About us</span>
            <br />
            <div class="infotextbox">
                <span class="infotext">
                    Peely is a newly opened online store where you can buy the freshest bananas.<br />
                    Our passion has always been to give the consumers exactly what they want… because no one! should settle for less than they deserve.<br />
                    That is why after our success with our previous store Spudly we decided to extend our business.
                    For a while now we have been investigating bananas in the store… and we have noticed that finding the perfect bananas is near impossible… but then we questioned ourselves… what is a perfect banana… because what we consider perfect might not be perfect for someone else.<br />
                    That is why we put our passion towards building this website to allow consumers to buy exactly what they define perfect.<br />
                    With a huge variation in products Peely offers all types of bananas from all over the world. Allowing the customer to choose exactly what they desire.<br />
                    With the help from banana farms all over the world building this business has been seamless. From our quality suppliers we can ensure that every banana that we ship out will be in top quality. Because that is our top priority.<br />
                    Every banana that we ship out has been taken care of with consideration and made sure to please our customers.<br />
                    Bananas are an important part of the day and that is why we want to make sure that everyone gets a chance to experience the day changing event that is eating a banana.
                    At Peely we value our customers as much as our products and wish to create a wonderful experience for both parties.<br />
                    We are a zero waste company who also focus on their carbon dioxide emission to be as kind to the planet as possible… because without this planet there would be no Peely.<br />
                    Special thanks to our sponsors who decided to invest in Peely and change the banana market forever. To create this website we specially thank our Spudly customers who keep supporting our potato business contributing to help the potato market and bring premium quality potatoes to all families.<br />
                    We also thank bananas for all which is a newly opened organisation helping small and big companies creating contacts all around the world between suppliers and sellers. Without them this wouldn't have been possible!<br />
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div>
            <span class="heading2" id="abourteam">About our team</span>
           <br />
            <div class="infotextbox">
                <span class="infotext">
                    There are numerous people who constantly help maintain Peely. Currently Peely has their own small team of one person. However, we are looking to extend this number. Our team works day and night to give customers the best experience buying our products.<br />
                    On the fields where we grow our organic bananas we ensure that the workers have the best work experience there is. Paying them for their hard work ensures that the work conditions stay the best.<br />
                    Our team works on giving the best to those who chose to buy their bananas at our website.<br />
                    Whilst we also work hard on expanding and making the shopping experience its best.<br />
                    Our team is solely made of those who are the most passionate about bananas. And those who want the best for the banana market.<br />
                    We are also excited to share our continued work with our sponsors who keep helping Peely grow and making bananas accessible for anyone who needs it.<br />
                    That is one of our main goals at Peely and our team's ambition to make bananas accessible for anyone who needs them at a price that most can afford.<br />
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="heading2box">
            <span class="heading2" id="abpro">Our products</span>
            <br />
            <div class="infotextbox">
                <span class="infotext">
                    Our bananas grow on organic trees that grow under natural circumstances. We try to make sure that all bananas that we sell at Peely are nourished and grown as natural as possible. <br />
                    Our workers have specially been trained to take care of bananas and harvest them in the most natural way possible.<br />
                    All the way from the seed we plant into the organic soil to the beautiful banana that grows on the trees are all chemical free and organic.<br />
                    Whilst consumers have to pay the price of organically grown fruits, at Peely the prices stay low for our customers, not needing to pay extra for this premium experience…<br />
                    We offer various bananas from all around the world. From wherever you decide to buy your bananas from we ensure that they have been grown organically and been nourished with care.<br />
                    Our bananas are fresh, juicy and filled with flavour. Guaranteeing rich flavour and an amazing eating experience.
                    No matter if you decide to eat them raw or use the bananas for baking they work just as well. Our bananas are amazing no matter what and will surely impress you.<br />
                    Every banana that leaves our company is personally cared for and made sure to amaze the family that will receive them.<br />
                    Since we are a zero waste company we make sure that even our bananas that don't get bought have the chance to achieve something spectacular. That is why under our products you will be able to save the bananas that otherwise would go to waste. There you can find the bananas that are imperfect to the eye but perfect for our taste buds.<br />
                    Whilst this way most of our bananas get bought and sent out to a loyal customer to make them happy… not all our products get the chance to get bought…<br />
                    That is why Peely donates those bananas to charities that otherwise would go to waste, to minimise our waste produce as well as putting a smile on those faces who need our help the most.<br />
                    Not only do we donate our bananas but also 60% of the “save a banana” purchases and 20% of overall purchases on Peely.<br />
                    No matter who you are or where you are, everyone has the chance to experience the amazing Peely bananas.<br />
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div>
            <span class="heading2" id="history">About our history</span>
            <br />
            <div class="infotextbox">
                <span class="infotext">
                    2023 we started Spudly with a dream to change the potato market and eliminate the issue of settling for the lesser potato.<br />
                    Since then Spudly have gained supporters all around the world with a humongous customer number.<br />
                    We can safely say that the potato market has been changed for the better and everyone has the chance to experience a perfect potato…<br />
                    Nevertheless, this success was a great achievement for the Spudly team who started out with a humble dream…<br />
                    However, we felt like we could not stop there. After wandering around in local stores shopping our daily groceries… a new dream started to awaken.<br />
                    We analysed the fruit and vegetables market and noticed that there are still some faults in it.<br />
                    That's when we decided that we wouldn't stop at Spudly and will continue our ambition not only with changing the potato market but changing the whole of the fruit and vegetables market.<br />
                    Alas, this dream is not a small one… and changing how we consume fruits and vegetables will take a long time… We realised then that maybe we should give up. Changing one market is doable but changing the entire market of fruits and vegetables is preposterous.<br />
                    But then we got a spark… we looked at all our Spudly customers and their happy smiles when they finally received their perfect potato and how happy they looked…<br />
                    That was when we swore an ought between us… that no matter what, we would continue our ambition and will make even more people smile all around the world.<br />
                    We will succeed. We will start small but as our team grows we will speed up the process and make it accessible for anyone to buy the perfect vegetable or fruit for them.<br />
                    That is why we decided to start with changing the banana market with Peely… <br />
                    We hope that with Peely we can change the banana market as we changed the potato market with Spudly…<br />
                    Day and night we struggled to make this happen… but eventually we succeeded thanks to our sponsors and numerous other people.<br />
                    This is just the beginning. We will continue our journey and give our customers exactly what they want.<br />
                    Thank you for your continued support!<br />
                </span>
                <div>
                    <img class="spudsuport" src="~/Resources/amazingsupporters.png"/><br />
                    <span class="infotext ty">Thank you!</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="heading2box">
            <span class="heading2" id="aboutstore">About our newly opened store</span>
            <br />
            <div class="infotextbox">
                <span class="infotext">
                    As of 2024 with the help of many people we have succeeded in making our customers' wishes a reality.<br />
                    At Peely we listen to our customers.<br />
                    We worked hard but finally succeeded in opening a physical store.<br />
                    In Utah Lehi you will be able to find our newest store.<br />
                    In the store the same quality will be presented like on our website. Whilst the variation of products is hard to maintain you will find your favourites at the store as well as on our websites.<br />
                    Our limited edition products will always be accessible in store as well as our customers' favourites.<br />
                    We have an amazing team in the store who will be ready to help you out and make sure that your shopping goes swiftly. Our staff will guide you if you are stuck and help you with recipes and tips on which banana or potato is the perfect for you.<br />
                    Whilst we do let our customers buy huge amounts of product at the same time in store it is harder to make sure that huge amounts are accessible all year around.<br />
                    However if you wish to pick up a bigger amount of product make sure to contact us and we will ensure that your order will be ready to pick up.<br />
                    If you can't find your favourite in store make sure to either contact us on our website or talk to our staff members. They will help you out!<br />
                    Our opening hours are:<br />
                                          <span class="openingh">
                                              Monday - Friday: 8am - 19pm<br />
                                              Saturday: 8am - 21pm<br />
                                              Sunday: 9am - 17pm<br />
                                          </span>
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
